<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 74.55 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS WED.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 74.55 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS WED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 74.55 million rand worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after buying a net 13.96 million rand on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
